* SN74LVC1G38 portable ngspice behavioural port
*
* Provenance: pin order, supply range, open-drain NAND function, and Ioff
* intent are derived from TI's SN74LVC1G38 PSpice model (SCEM629) and
* datasheet. This is an independently written portable behavioural model; it
* does not include TI model source text.
*
* Pin order: Y, A, B, VCC, GND
* Scope: static default-high safety topology. Below the rated VCC floor the
* output is high impedance, representing the required Ioff-safe behaviour.

.subckt SN74LVC1G38_NGSPICE Y A B VCC GND
+ params: VCC_MIN=1.65 RON=10

B_OD Y GND I={ternary_fcn(v(VCC,GND)>=VCC_MIN,ternary_fcn((v(A,GND)>0.5*v(VCC,GND))*(v(B,GND)>0.5*v(VCC,GND)),v(Y,GND)/RON,0),0)}
.ends SN74LVC1G38_NGSPICE
